  "schema": 1,
  "about": "ReplicationScheduler choices. Each tick: credit = min(credit, 0) + budget; every candidate's accumulator grows by its priority, except a body at rest after three confirmations (accumulator held at zero); candidates sort by accumulator descending, then priority descending, then the scheduler's send count at their last send ascending (never sent is zero), then id ascending; the first is sent while credit is positive, later ones only if they fit; a sent accumulator resets. Entities missing from a tick are forgotten.",
  "restConfirmationSends": 3,
  "candidateFields": [
    "id",
    "priority",
    "sizeBytes",
    "atRest"
  ],
